        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Days 2–3 are spent crossing the Drake Passage. Cool, salty winds, ocean swells and seabirds accompany you as you sail south. You may see whales during the crossing. Look out for wandering, grey-headed, black-browed and light-mantled albatrosses, Cape petrels, southern fulmars, Wilson’s storm petrels, and blue and Antarctic petrels."
    },
