      },
      "text": "Antarctic Convergence"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d51a32befa36a15a6526d238de2bfa66a2e92f1f731b3e5bd1396cd0976bbf1d",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6lzct9-a8m9x2yez",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Continue your two-day crossing of the Drake Passage. The ship crosses the Antarctic Convergence, where cold waters flowing north meet warmer subantarctic waters. The marine life and the mix of seabirds change as you cross. Watch from the ship. Wildlife sightings depend on natural conditions."
